  "notes": "Sankhamul and Buddhanagar: dense four-storey RCC blocks between the Bagmati corridor and Sankhamul Marg, with a cluster of schools and colleges in institutional style and shops and banks in the north-east. Two implausible height tags (a 50 m and a 40 m house) and a 23-storey tag on a 58 m2 footprint are replaced by storey counts. Three temples mapped as points inside small buildings are styled as brick temples."
